inmys ELVEES IMX477 / YOLOv8n demo
Application source: Apache-2.0, adapted from the user's RV1126B inmys-vision.
HTTP MJPEG, GStreamer RTSP, COCO labels and bitmap font are reused.
Rockchip RKNN/RGA/MPP/RKAIQ backends are not included.
CSI/ISP uses ELVEES Felix binaries and separately built GPL kernel modules.
YOLOv8n uses ElcoreNN 1.8.0 on ELcore50 DSP (no libcpunn CPU backend).
Runtime and its matching dependencies come from ELVEES SDK 2025.09.
YOLOv8n model: Ultralytics, converted/distributed in ELVEES examples data
20260128; AGPL-3.0. https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
H.264/MJPEG use the Mali-V61 VPU through ELVEES gst-omx and libmveomx.
Software x264/jpegenc remain available via an explicit command-line option.
